\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Gladsome light, O grace
\par Of God the Father's face,
\par The eternal splendour wearing;
\par Celestial, holy, blest,
\par Our Saviour Jesus Christ,
\par Joyful in Thine appearing.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Now, ere day fadeth quite,
\par We see the evening light,
\par Our wonted hymn outpouring;
\par Father of might unknown,
\par Thee, His incarnate Son,
\par And Holy Spirit adoring.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. To Thee of right belongs
\par All praise of holy songs,
\par O Son of God, lifegiver;
\par Thee, therefore, O Most High,
\par The world doth glorify,
\par And shall exalt for ever.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

